OL,3,AIran war won't end until after crucial
OL,4,ANovember elections, says Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,Fdoes not think the Iran war will end
OL,8,Funtil after November's midterm
OL,9,Felections, adding that oil prices will
OL,10,Fnot come down until then.
OL,12,F"I think the war's going to end
OL,13,Fimmediately after the election because
OL,14,Fthey can't hold out any longer," Trump
OL,15,Fsaid of Iran's leaders on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
