OL,3,AIran war won't end until after crucial
OL,4,ANovember elections, says Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe made the comments as he headed to
OL,7,FTexas for the Republican Party's first
OL,8,Fmidterm election convention ` and
OL,9,Frepeated them there, arguing that
OL,10,Fshort-term economic pain was worth it
OL,11,Fto prevent Iran from developing nuclear
OL,12,Fweapons.
OL,14,FTrump is facing falling polling numbers
OL,15,Fand pressure from within his party to
OL,16,Fend the war, which began when the US
OL,17,Fand Israel attacked Iran in February.
